WEBVTT

00:00:04.650 --> 00:00:07.530
Takamura's Flight 2, exterminate 
the Destroyer Class!

00:00:07.530 --> 00:00:09.480
Flight 2, roger!

00:00:09.480 --> 00:00:12.570
Flight 1 under my command, cover Flight 3!

00:00:12.570 --> 00:00:14.960
Flight 3, concentrate fire 
on individual Grappler Class,

00:00:14.960 --> 00:00:17.540
and prioritize any Laser Class you see!

00:00:17.540 --> 00:00:19.210
Flight 3, roger!

00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:56.980
Here they come...

00:02:26.950 --> 00:02:31.950
{i}The Imperial Capital Burns - Part 2

00:02:35.360 --> 00:02:36.520
Here they come...

00:02:39.260 --> 00:02:40.810
Draw them in as close as possible!

00:02:41.510 --> 00:02:43.500
Keep TSF altitude below 100m!

00:02:43.500 --> 00:02:44.290
Roger!

00:02:54.650 --> 00:02:55.520
That's...

00:02:56.230 --> 00:02:57.030
BETA?!

00:02:57.760 --> 00:02:58.390
Move it!

00:02:58.840 --> 00:03:01.150
Shift formation to intercept! Arrowhead 1!

00:03:02.000 --> 00:03:03.480
All units, fire at will!

00:03:03.480 --> 00:03:04.400
Let's go!

00:03:04.400 --> 00:03:05.470
Roger!

00:03:18.780 --> 00:03:20.620
Remember your training, Shimako!

00:03:21.840 --> 00:03:23.070
How do you fight a Destroyer Class?

00:03:23.620 --> 00:03:25.090
I-I know!

00:03:43.370 --> 00:03:44.160
Watch out for lasers!

00:03:45.090 --> 00:03:46.150
You're too high!

00:03:51.790 --> 00:03:53.650
Shimako?

00:03:54.390 --> 00:03:55.030
Don't falter!

00:03:55.480 --> 00:03:58.050
If you get up close to one of 
them, the lasers won't fire!

00:03:59.700 --> 00:04:01.340
Where's our target Laser Class?

00:04:01.870 --> 00:04:04.520
Forward-right, 1200.
Right in front of the relay station.

00:04:05.670 --> 00:04:06.560
I see them!

00:04:06.560 --> 00:04:07.530
Lock...

00:04:24.700 --> 00:04:26.110
They're still coming?

00:04:27.610 --> 00:04:30.030
Low ammunition warning.

00:04:41.810 --> 00:04:43.730
Aki! Are you alright?

00:04:44.760 --> 00:04:45.570
Yui...

00:04:46.470 --> 00:04:48.180
Start to focus fire on a single target!

00:04:48.180 --> 00:04:50.310
Don't let the enemy 
concentrate on Flight 3!

00:04:50.310 --> 00:04:51.730
Roger!

00:05:16.760 --> 00:05:17.730
I did it!

00:05:17.730 --> 00:05:18.870
I did it, Yui!

00:05:18.870 --> 00:05:22.250
I survived the 8 minutes of death! Now I'm...

00:05:28.200 --> 00:05:29.450
Aki?

00:05:33.370 --> 00:05:34.530
I'm not going to let you fire!

00:05:36.450 --> 00:05:37.540
Hit.

00:05:39.810 --> 00:05:42.610
Hit! One more at the rocks to your left!

00:05:45.760 --> 00:05:46.740
More?

00:05:50.790 --> 00:05:54.240
What's going on? It was supposed
to be a single group!

00:05:54.560 --> 00:05:56.130
Command post, respond!

00:05:58.450 --> 00:06:00.670
These trainees won't hold them off...

00:06:00.670 --> 00:06:01.980
What on earth are the regular soldiers doing?

00:06:03.170 --> 00:06:05.010
Command post, respond!

00:06:04.980 --> 00:06:08.380
 Arashiyama Supply Base - Fallen

00:06:05.680 --> 00:06:06.900
Command post?

00:06:19.420 --> 00:06:21.010
Flight 3 will resupply first, then the others!

00:06:21.290 --> 00:06:22.530
All other flights, cover them!

00:06:30.570 --> 00:06:32.020
C-Captain!

00:06:41.670 --> 00:06:44.010
We'll never let them into Kyoto!

00:06:45.460 --> 00:06:49.330
Yawata Defense Line - Broken

00:06:50.400 --> 00:06:53.120
These losses exceed our 
original predictions...

00:06:53.670 --> 00:06:55.290
What's the American army doing?

00:06:55.290 --> 00:06:59.630
They're launching the TSFs carried aboard 
the Theodore Roosevelt in Lake Biwa Canal,

00:06:59.590 --> 00:07:03.070
American Navy F-14 Tomcat

00:06:59.900 --> 00:07:01.740
and continuing to provide support.

00:07:06.010 --> 00:07:07.370
What a strong sense of duty.

00:07:09.040 --> 00:07:11.300
But there won't be enough of them.

00:07:11.930 --> 00:07:15.430
The Guard may be 
forced to make a hard call.

00:07:16.170 --> 00:07:17.190
A hard call?

00:07:19.180 --> 00:07:21.230
Yui... Don't die.

00:07:21.920 --> 00:07:25.740
Biwa Lake

00:07:29.300 --> 00:07:33.320
Owari, Flagship of the 
Imperial Navy's 2nd Fleet

00:07:29.820 --> 00:07:33.320
Admiral! Please confirm the 
operation with HQ one more time!

00:07:34.700 --> 00:07:36.470
Prepare the main battery!

00:07:36.470 --> 00:07:37.570
Admiral?

00:07:37.570 --> 00:07:39.330
I said prepare the main battery!

00:07:39.900 --> 00:07:42.040
Prepare the main battery!

00:07:42.040 --> 00:07:43.650
Prepare the main battery!

00:08:06.730 --> 00:08:07.870
We're surrounded!

00:08:08.260 --> 00:08:09.720
There's too many of them!

00:08:17.340 --> 00:08:18.560
I'm out of ammo!

00:08:18.560 --> 00:08:19.520
Last one!

00:08:22.680 --> 00:08:23.810
120mm, 0!

00:08:23.810 --> 00:08:25.150
36mm, 500!

00:08:25.150 --> 00:08:26.640
36mm, 1 clip!

00:08:26.640 --> 00:08:28.240
Remaining ammo, 450!

00:08:28.870 --> 00:08:31.880
There's no more point in 
holding this position...

00:08:32.620 --> 00:08:33.890
All flights, listen up!

00:08:34.510 --> 00:08:36.170
Withdraw from this battlefield at once!

00:08:36.530 --> 00:08:38.290
Fall back to Line 8!

00:08:53.090 --> 00:08:54.580
Izumi! Fall back!

00:08:56.560 --> 00:08:57.290
Izumi!

00:09:01.180 --> 00:09:02.390
No!

00:09:03.060 --> 00:09:05.180
I can't run away!

00:09:05.180 --> 00:09:08.720
Revenge! I will get my revenge here!

00:09:10.220 --> 00:09:10.840
You!

00:09:10.930 --> 00:09:11.960
You!

00:09:13.000 --> 00:09:13.720
You!

00:09:13.970 --> 00:09:14.970
Pilot officer Noto!

00:09:25.890 --> 00:09:28.000
Hurry, the enemy is massing together!

00:09:28.660 --> 00:09:29.740
Laser Warning

00:09:30.890 --> 00:09:32.150
More Laser Class?

00:09:32.720 --> 00:09:34.750
Don't worry! So long as you don't fly high-

00:09:35.770 --> 00:09:36.980
Squadron Commander?

00:09:41.720 --> 00:09:42.750
At this altitude?

00:09:43.320 --> 00:09:45.260
They've widened the firing 
angle of their lasers!

00:09:48.920 --> 00:09:50.430
What do we do?

00:09:50.430 --> 00:09:53.220
It's 120 seconds to a ridge 
that'll provide cover!

00:09:58.820 --> 00:10:00.980
Do something, Yui!

00:10:01.390 --> 00:10:03.810
Takamura! Take command!

00:10:03.810 --> 00:10:05.570
At this rate, we're all goners!

00:10:11.500 --> 00:10:12.510
Alright.

00:10:12.980 --> 00:10:15.340
Maintain heading and set 
engine output to maximum!

00:10:15.340 --> 00:10:17.000
Fly as low as possible!

00:10:18.280 --> 00:10:19.630
Anti-laser smoke!

00:10:28.620 --> 00:10:29.550
Can we make it?

00:10:34.680 --> 00:10:35.550
It's no use!

00:10:35.750 --> 00:10:36.790
Don't give up!

00:10:37.430 --> 00:10:38.550
90 seconds to the ridge!

00:10:42.790 --> 00:10:45.250
Low. Low. Like you're stuck to the ground.

00:10:53.170 --> 00:10:54.480
We're done for!

00:10:54.720 --> 00:10:55.740
Only 60 seconds!

00:11:07.840 --> 00:11:08.680
What?

00:11:08.680 --> 00:11:10.420
Firing... from a ship's guns?

00:11:23.470 --> 00:11:25.620
I share your regret, Admiral.

00:11:27.260 --> 00:11:30.930
A soldier carries out the 
mission he is given.

00:11:32.040 --> 00:11:34.430
I'll bear the full responsibility for this.

00:12:10.770 --> 00:12:15.430
Our 1200 year old Imperial 
Capital... Japan is done for...

00:12:30.420 --> 00:12:32.810
This is Arashiyama Flight 2,

00:12:32.810 --> 00:12:34.370
somebody please respond.

00:12:34.370 --> 00:12:36.290
We are cut off and isolated on line 3.

00:12:35.420 --> 00:12:37.150
Everyone is going to be eaten...

00:12:36.290 --> 00:12:37.180
Orders, please.

00:12:37.180 --> 00:12:37.930
Eaten?

00:12:38.540 --> 00:12:40.540
You saw it in lecture, didn't you?

00:12:40.540 --> 00:12:41.960
The BETA eat people!

00:12:42.590 --> 00:12:43.730
They'll eat us too!

00:12:43.730 --> 00:12:45.690
Izumi! Get it together!

00:12:45.690 --> 00:12:48.420
We've all survived past 
the 8 minutes of death!

00:12:48.420 --> 00:12:50.620
So what is the next thing we should be doing?

00:12:51.320 --> 00:12:54.260
I want revenge...

00:12:55.250 --> 00:12:56.100
For him!

00:12:56.680 --> 00:12:57.540
For everyone!

00:12:58.820 --> 00:13:00.220
You can have it.

00:13:00.220 --> 00:13:03.170
Live on in their stead, and fight the BETA.

00:13:03.430 --> 00:13:04.290
Yes...

00:13:06.870 --> 00:13:08.410
A signal on the motion sensor!

00:13:13.170 --> 00:13:15.590
There's nothing here. Is the sensor...

00:13:17.920 --> 00:13:18.720
Oh no!

00:13:27.370 --> 00:13:28.070
It's too close!

00:13:30.480 --> 00:13:31.440
Izumi, shoot!

00:13:41.530 --> 00:13:42.530
Izumi.

00:13:42.530 --> 00:13:44.110
I-It wasn't me!

00:13:50.890 --> 00:13:53.390
A Type-94... Mk. 1-C?

00:13:59.700 --> 00:14:04.260
Now that you've survived the 8 minutes of 
death, are you feeling a bit more like soldiers?

00:14:07.640 --> 00:14:08.500
Instructor!

00:14:08.870 --> 00:14:10.640
Call me Captain out here.

00:14:11.250 --> 00:14:12.880
Pardon me, Captain!

00:14:13.590 --> 00:14:17.870
I picked up your call sign 
when I made my retreat.

00:14:21.860 --> 00:14:24.990
Now... I'll cover you as you retreat.

00:14:25.400 --> 00:14:28.340
You all head for Kyoto station on Line 8.

00:14:28.340 --> 00:14:30.080
That's the rally point.

00:14:31.700 --> 00:14:34.350
If all goes well, you should 
be able to resupply there.

00:14:34.590 --> 00:14:35.680
But...

00:14:35.680 --> 00:14:37.660
Are you disobeying an 
order from your superior?

00:14:40.980 --> 00:14:41.930
Go!

00:14:53.640 --> 00:14:57.540
Become a true soldier by 
the next time we meet...

00:15:29.620 --> 00:15:30.760
Command post,

00:15:30.760 --> 00:15:34.960
this is Arashiyama Flight 2, requesting 
permission to approach from the west.

00:15:37.640 --> 00:15:38.930
It's Kyoto station!

00:15:38.930 --> 00:15:40.710
Watch your surroundings, 
don't let your guard down!

00:15:42.760 --> 00:15:43.610
A Fort Class?

00:15:44.570 --> 00:15:45.620
Look out!

00:16:12.930 --> 00:16:14.920
Thanks for lasting as long as you did.

00:16:23.750 --> 00:16:25.480
Yamashiro-san, Izumi.

00:16:26.220 --> 00:16:27.470
If you can hear me, respond.

00:16:42.500 --> 00:16:43.410
Izumi?

00:17:23.670 --> 00:17:24.960
Soldier Class...

00:17:31.340 --> 00:17:32.560
Takamura-san...

00:17:34.110 --> 00:17:36.560
Yamashiro-san? Where are you?

00:18:02.180 --> 00:18:03.800
Yamashiro-san? Are you alright?

00:18:10.930 --> 00:18:13.420
Takamura-san... please...

00:18:13.420 --> 00:18:14.770
Yamashiro-san...

00:18:19.070 --> 00:18:19.770
...ease...

00:18:20.570 --> 00:18:21.640
Please...

00:18:23.250 --> 00:18:24.040
Please!

00:18:26.470 --> 00:18:27.560
Please!

00:18:27.870 --> 00:18:28.840
Please!

00:18:29.680 --> 00:18:30.650
Please!

00:18:30.930 --> 00:18:31.980
Yamashiro-san?

00:18:34.310 --> 00:18:35.280
Please...

00:18:35.650 --> 00:18:36.680
shoot...

00:18:37.450 --> 00:18:38.410
me...

00:18:39.470 --> 00:18:40.350
Hurry!

00:18:41.310 --> 00:18:42.360
Please...

00:18:47.560 --> 00:18:49.620
Shoot me!

00:18:49.620 --> 00:18:51.530
Before these things eat me!

00:18:52.250 --> 00:18:54.060
Yui!

00:19:27.620 --> 00:19:30.230
I can't... I...

00:20:18.370 --> 00:20:20.720
A Takemikazuchi?

00:20:59.820 --> 00:21:01.440
The day I woke up...

00:21:08.250 --> 00:21:13.320
That was the day Kyoto 
fell, overrun by the BETA.

00:21:15.180 --> 00:21:20.160
Someone had said that this 
world was going to end...

00:21:23.450 --> 00:21:24.480
When was it?

00:21:25.610 --> 00:21:28.670
When did the living stop counting the dead?

00:21:34.030 --> 00:21:38.600
Is this world truly walking 
the path to extinction?

00:21:40.570 --> 00:21:42.560
Where did you go, Takamura-san?

00:21:42.820 --> 00:21:44.940
You're in no condition to be walking around!

00:21:45.860 --> 00:21:48.240
I'm begging you, please get some rest!

00:22:03.420 --> 00:22:05.860
No, it's not.

00:22:08.650 --> 00:22:11.470
Are you alright, Takamura-san? 
Does it hurt anywhere?

00:22:19.350 --> 00:22:23.220
{i}Three years later

00:22:32.720 --> 00:22:35.330
That day, I carved my rejection 
of extinction in my heart,

00:22:36.260 --> 00:22:41.610
along with my vow that 
I would never cry again.

00:24:06.510 --> 00:24:08.390
You should be careful.

00:24:08.390 --> 00:24:11.690
I heard that he was the Raptor's test pilot.

00:24:11.690 --> 00:24:13.320
Doesn't matter.

00:24:13.320 --> 00:24:16.470
I'll have him go through 
the Argos Flight's baptism.

00:24:16.470 --> 00:24:20.450
What's a top elite from the 
American army doing out here?

00:24:20.740 --> 00:24:23.110
Next time on Total Eclipse:

00:24:23.120 --> 00:24:24.400
Verdant Yukon
